  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and transformer aggregation achieve high accuracy (e.g., config_039: 0.724989). This experiment tests whether replacing the imagenet_vit_l image encoder with resnet50 (a simpler model) maintains performance, clarifying the importance of image encoder choice. It balances exploitation of promising components (scvi_n200, transformer) with exploration of alternative image encoders, which could reveal critical design decisions under limited budget."
